HI, NORIKAZU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method for producing nondeliquescent, crystalline calcium pantothenate comprising the steps of: (1) stirring a supersaturated aqueous solution containing calcium pantothenate in a proportion of 60 % (W/W) or more with, for example, a wet crusher to prepare a suspension of crystals; and (2) drying the suspension.  The method can be used for efficiently producing nondeliquescent, crystalline calcium pantothenate which is substantially free of an organic solvent.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Un procédé de production de pantothénate de calcium non déliquescent cristallin comprend les étapes consistant (1) à agiter une solution aqueuse supersaturée contenant du pantothénate de calcium en une proportion de 60 % en poids (W/W) ou davantage avec, par exemple, un broyeur humide afin de préparer une suspension de cristaux, et (2) à sécher la suspension. Le procédé peut être utilisé pour produire efficacement du pantothénate de calcium non déliquescent cristallin sensiblement exempt de solvant organique.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>